      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Diagnostic approach to and management of SHTG are not always straightforward and specialist knowledge is required, particularly with the expected increase in the rates of SHTG associated with obesity and diabetes epidemics. We hope that this article will prove helpful for physicians caring for such patients. Their management may be guided by our recommendations that are shown in Table 2."},
